# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTHING THAT IDENTIFIES A PLAYER GOES IN THIS REPO.
#
# Every tool here writes its outputs under a `data/` directory: captures of live
# games, match lookups, the collector's databases, feature tables, reports. Those
# hold other people's Riot IDs, PUUIDs and match records, and Riot's developer
# policies do not allow redistributing identifiable player data. So `data/` is
# ignored at EVERY depth -- deliberately unanchored -- and no code package may be
# called `data` (see lolmodel/lolwp/store/__init__.py for why).
#
# What IS publishable lives outside data/:
#   src/wincast/resources/   the fallback model (coefficients only) and Data Dragon prices
#   tests/fixtures/          ANONYMISED games only (Blue1#NA1 ... Red5#NA1)
#   docs/                    write-ups and curated charts
#
# `scripts/check_no_player_data.py` backs this up as a pre-commit hook:
#     git config core.hooksPath .githooks
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

data/
_to_delete/

# data formats that should never be committed even outside data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.db
*.parquet
*.jsonl
*.jsonl.gz
*.log
*.lock

# secrets
.env
*.env
!.env.example
config.local.*

# build output
build/
dist/

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# ad-hoc live API dumps at the repo root
/sample*.json
